      "writtenOn": "2021-06-02T17:08:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, this all feels a bit fragile. Where is the flag consumed? In the vendor implementation of select_task_rq_*()? If so, could we simply replace this wake flag by a flag in the VENDOR part of task_struct?",
